DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nWhat to Say After R U OK (For Managers)\nSynopsis\n:\
	nLearn “What to say after R U OK?” with Joanne\n \nJoin this session t
	o gain valuable insights on mental health and well-being\, and why support
	ing mental wellness at work matters. Learn from Joanne how to recognize ea
	rly signs when a co-worker is struggling\, apply practical strategies to i
	nitiate conversations with empathy\, and provide meaningful support to emp
	ower others. Sign-up and learn how you could make a tangible difference in
	 someone's life.\nSpeaker\n:\nJoanne Foong Ming HOR\nJoining Instructions\
	n(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS l
	aptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <h
	ttps://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn
	_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the eve
	nt. This will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optim
	al streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyper
	link: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e3cf8
	eeba38e206605d89de4272e0e8da> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Ema
	il Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Downl
	oad Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on 
	Join Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2514 051 6829\n2.	Input Password 1234
	\n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDia
	l:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDi
	al:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2514 051 6829\nG
	lobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e67
	6867362e0173666ba5856cc26881d5> \n \n \n \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230719T175000
